TAVILY_API_KEY="your_yavily_api_key"
GROQ_API_KEY="your_groq_api_key"

## OPTIONAL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

## CORS: comma-separated list of allowed origins for the FastAPI backend
## Development default: http://localhost:5500, http://127.0.0.1:5500, http://localhost:8000, http://127.0.0.1:8000
## Production: set to your GitHub Pages URL (e.g., https://yourname.github.io/fasteat-ai)
ALLOWED_ORIGINS="http://localhost:5500, http://127.0.0.1:5500, http://localhost:8000, http://127.0.0.1:8000"

## Image upload limit: maximum file size in MB (default: 5)
MAX_IMAGE_MB="5"